  <div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.5in;width:7.5in;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.5in;"><div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><a href="#toc_page"><span style="color:#0000ff;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline solid;display:inline-block;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div></div>
  <div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.5in;width:7.5in;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.5in;"><div style="padding-top:0.5in;z-index:2;min-height:0.5in;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.5in;width:7.5in;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.5in;"><p style="text-indent:-36pt;padding-left:36pt;font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#002e6d;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Q:</span><span style="color:#002e6d;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">	What am I voting on, how many votes are required to approve each item, how are votes counted and how does the Board recommend I vote?</span><span style="color:#002e6d;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#d9272e;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">A:</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">	The table below summarizes the proposals that will be voted on, the vote required to approve each item, how votes are counted, and how the Board recommends you vote.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
    <table style="margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;table-layout:auto;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;">
     <tr style="background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;visibility:collapse;">
      <td style="width:16%;box-sizing:content-box;"/>
      <td style="width:1.92%;box-sizing:content-box;"/>
