      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0.056in;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #d9272e;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="font-size:8.5pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#8220;FOR&#8221;<br/>&#8220;AGAINST&#8221;<br/>&#8220;ABSTAIN&#8221;</span></p></td>
