"color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> and 2024; Anthony Colucci and Craig Brubaker for fiscal 2023 and 2022; and Anthony Colucci for fiscal 2021.</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><p style="text-indent:-11.5pt;padding-left:11.5pt;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(3) </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_7bb71ead-6d9c-4a54-9191-95b47419afaa" contextRef="C_b1f6c20c-928a-4006-9b4c-b383dec6dc22" name="ecd:AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_7bb71ead-6d9c-4a54-9191-95b47419afaa_1"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_0a780b32-d8c1-48a1-a32c-578144c9b712" contextRef="C_b1f6c20c-928a-4006-9b4c-b383dec6dc22" name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_0a780b32-d8c1-48a1-a32c-578144c9b712_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Compensation &#8220;actually paid&#8221; is calculated in accordance with Item 402(v) of Regulation S-K. The tables below sets forth each adjustment made during each year presented in the table to calculate the compensation &#8220;actually paid&#8221; to our NEOs during each year in the table: </span></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style=""></span></p><div style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_7bb71ead-6d9c-4a54-9191-95b47419afaa_1"><ix:continuation id="F_0a780b32-d8c1-48a1-a32c-578144c9b712_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
