obal Inc.; Herc Holdings Inc.; BlueLinx Holdings Inc.; Trinity Industries, Inc; MarineMax, Inc.; DNOW Inc.; The Manitowoc Company, Inc.; Titan Machinery Inc.; Custom Truck One Source, Inc.; OneWater Marine Inc.; DXP Enterprises, Inc.; H&amp;E Equipment Services, Inc; Astec Industries, Inc.; Monro, Inc.; Global Industrial Company; America&#8217;s Car-Mart, Inc.; and McGrath RentCorp. The peer groups used to calculate Peer Group Total Shareholder Return in prior years are disclosed in our 2025 and 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> proxy statements.</span></div></div></ix:nonNumeric></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.15000000000000002in;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:2%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(6)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_9d77cca6-769a-4ba8-99fe-0e10946343ff" contextRef="C_e4caf8be-2bda-4b33-9482-0e45c8b48e03" name="ecd:NonGaapMeasureDescriptionTextBlock" escape="true"><span style="font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_77373632-7ece-4f5a-a45f-dcca38b04d80" contextRef="C_b1f6c20c-928a-4006-9b4c-b383dec6dc22" name="ecd:CoSelectedMeasureName"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Economic EBIT Yield</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> is a measure assessing the Company&#8217;s performance with respect to its return on invested capital. For more information regarding Economic EBIT Yield, see Appendix B.</span></ix:nonNumeric></span